{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the game community on Discord:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838620/extras/6cb11063f14c92e58569c59d80eb61d0.avif?t=1768168503\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use democracy as an instrument and defeat your opponents with strategic moves! Take your place at a table where everything can be done for victory in the power struggle. You are faced with a political party management game, inspired by the political atmosphere of the 1970s and 1980s, enriched with humor elements. In this game, shape your country with clever strategies and political maneuvers and get ahead in the leadership race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838620/extras/fa7a0bf8839b414298584d865af0db21.avif?t=1768168503\" width=616 height=199 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Country Balance</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of gray routines and low-yield moves? Then it\u2019s time to shake your country a bit! Rise in the midst of chaos, but be on guard against the risk of getting lost in this chaos! As you change the situation of the country from beginning to end, use the advantage of chaos with the most effective strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Come to Power</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Did you lose the elections? Don\u2019t worry, you have alternatives like civil war and coup; just be a good politician.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Change the Management</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Democracy is dead; would socialist dictatorship or theocracy interest you? It\u2019s free to try! In Statecraft, there are many management systems and game endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make Allies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can agree with players or radical groups in the country. Just make sure you watch your back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Politicize the Apolitical</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Does too much vote harm? Turn the apolitical in the regions into your own supporters. You can eliminate opposing groups by organizing intrigues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >War</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you taken over the management of the country? Why not enlarge your country by taking land from neighbors? Now it\u2019s time to color the map.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2838620?t=1768168503","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838620/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768168503","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838620/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768168503","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838620/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768168503","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3784260,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the game community on Discord:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838620/extras/6cb11063f14c92e58569c59d80eb61d0.avif?t=1768168503\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use democracy as an instrument and defeat your opponents with strategic moves! Take your place at a table where everything can be done for victory in the power struggle. You are faced with a political party management game, inspired by the political atmosphere of the 1970s and 1980s, enriched with humor elements. In this game, shape your country with clever strategies and political maneuvers and get ahead in the leadership race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838620/extras/fa7a0bf8839b414298584d865af0db21.avif?t=1768168503\" width=616 height=199 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Country Balance</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of gray routines and low-yield moves? Then it\u2019s time to shake your country a bit! Rise in the midst of chaos, but be on guard against the risk of getting lost in this chaos! As you change the situation of the country from beginning to end, use the advantage of chaos with the most effective strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Come to Power</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Did you lose the elections? Don\u2019t worry, you have alternatives like civil war and coup; just be a good politician.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Change the Management</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Democracy is dead; would socialist dictatorship or theocracy interest you? It\u2019s free to try! In Statecraft, there are many management systems and game endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make Allies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can agree with players or radical groups in the country. Just make sure you watch your back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Politicize the Apolitical</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Does too much vote harm? Turn the apolitical in the regions into your own supporters. You can eliminate opposing groups by organizing intrigues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >War</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you taken over the management of the country? Why not enlarge your country by taking land from neighbors? Now it\u2019s time to color the map.</p>","developers":["Engincan \u00c7i\u00e7ek"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838620/header.jpg?t=1768168503","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2838620/994036019/b3307a22244110634eeef525f8338693b1fb2944/1768167256/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768168502","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2838620/994036019/b3307a22244110634eeef525f8338693b1fb2944/1768167256/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768168502","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2838620/994036019/b3307a22244110634eeef525f8338693b1fb2944/1768167256/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1768168502","id":257263252,"name":"Seconder Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257263252/e01cade30b0930382a64e4ab7b8818c085c708ff/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1768168502"}],"name":"Statecraft: Corrupted Democracy","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, 11 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 2.1 compatible graphics card, integrated graphics<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Engincan \u00c7i\u00e7ek"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drogas il\u00edcitas\nLinguagem impr\u00f3pria\nViol\u00eancia","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate"